# Tidy Tabs' groups and Library ▸ Archived Tabs (12 Nov 2026, the owner's calls): a group's header
# collapses and expands it, keeping only the open tab in sight while collapsed, and Move Group Up /
# Down reorders the groups; Archive Tabs (the header's menu) archives the group. A click on an archived
# tab restores it in the background with Arc's toast, a ⇧-click switches to it (ArchivedTabRestore).
# The groups are made by cra://debug?makeTabGroup=, as a model answer would (no Apple Intelligence).
budget rss=800 stalls50=30
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=1
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=2
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=3
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=4
wait 2
cra://debug?makeTabGroup=Alpha&tabs=2
cra://debug?makeTabGroup=Beta&tabs=2
wait 0.5
cra://debug?tabGroups=made
expect-log tab groups made: Alpha\(open rows=2/2\) Beta\(open rows=2/2\)

# Collapsed: its tabs are kept, only the open one (if it is in there) stays listed.
cra://debug?groupAction=collapse&group=Alpha
cra://debug?tabGroups=collapsed
expect-log tab groups collapsed: Alpha\(collapsed rows=[01]/2\) Beta\(open rows=2/2\)

# Move Group Down / Up: past the next group.
cra://debug?groupAction=down&group=Alpha
cra://debug?tabGroups=moved
expect-log tab groups moved: Beta\(open rows=2/2\) Alpha\(collapsed rows=[01]/2\)
cra://debug?groupAction=up&group=Alpha
cra://debug?groupAction=expand&group=Alpha
cra://debug?tabGroups=back
expect-log tab groups back: Alpha\(open rows=2/2\) Beta\(open rows=2/2\)

# Archive Tabs: the group's tabs go to the archive and its header with them.
cra://debug?groupAction=archive&group=Beta
wait 1
cra://debug?tabGroups=archived
expect-log tab groups archived: Alpha\(open rows=2/2\) tidy=

# A click restores in the background with the toast; ⇧-click restores and switches.
cra://debug?restoreArchived=0
expect-log archived tab restored in the background \(toast: Tab Restored · Show\)
cra://debug?restoreArchived=0&shift=1
expect-log archived tab restored and switched to
